<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
</spec>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="10" valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3.00 to 3.73 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>15°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2.45 to 2.88 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1.95 to 2.30 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>25°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1.60 to 1.80 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>30°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1.28 to 1.47 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>35°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1.00 to 1.22 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>40°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.80 to 1.00 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>45°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.65 to 0.85 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>50°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.50 to 0.70 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>55°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.44 to 0.60 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>60°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0.36 to 0.50 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Touching the temperature sensor part allows body heat to affect it and prevents a correct judgment, so hold the connector side when inspecting the sensor.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Allow the sensor to adjust to the ambient temperature before inspecting.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
